flowchart TD
  SRC[(Source DB / files / API)] --> EXT[Extract batch/incremental]
  EXT --> RAW[Raw] --> BRZ[Bronze]
  BRZ --> DQ{Data quality}
  DQ -- pass --> SLV[Silver]
  DQ -- fail --> Q[Quarantine + reason]
  SLV --> STAR[Star schema dims+facts] --> GLD[Gold]
  GLD --> ATH[Athena] & RS[Redshift] --> BI[BI]
